parts in the courtroom

00:12:57.443 --> 00:13:00.346 align:start size:97% position:3%
and say that they matter or,
or that someone would say

00:13:00.346 --> 00:13:03.182 align:start size:88% position:13%
that saying a biological
male is biological

00:13:03.182 --> 00:13:05.985 align:start size:81% position:19%
male is harmful
