00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:13.125 align:start size:97% position:3%
So we believe that in the
end, it's an important issue

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:15.528
for the protection of our
women and our daughters.

00:13:15.528 --> 00:13:18.564
And it's those, it's
the female athletes

00:13:18.564 --> 00:13:21.567
and women that are going to
suffer the brunt of this harm

00:13:21.567 --> 00:13:24.170 align:start size:97% position:3%
if we lose these biological
differences in the law.

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:25.604
- Yeah. Has that
been the weird part

00:13:25.604 --> 00:13:27.039 align:start size:84% position:16%
